  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODI STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In September 2020, the DCAD SMG agreed to a consolidation of Ireland&#x2019;s relationship with ODI. Putting our relationship on a consolidated institutional footing would have a number key strategic advantages, including enabling Ireland to tap into ODI&#x2019;s comparative advantages in analysis, knowledge management, convening power and clear communication of research projects. It would also be a vital draw-down resource on many issues key to the Security Council, and help address capacity shortages.</narrative>
  </description>
